<h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;">Password Protected Links</h1>
<p>Add a layer of security to sensitive links by requiring a password before redirecting.</p>

<h2>How It Works</h2>
<ol><li>When creating or editing a link, enter a <strong>Password</strong></li><li>When someone clicks the link, they see a password entry page</li><li>After entering the correct password, they're redirected to the destination</li><li>A cookie is set so they don't have to re-enter the password on subsequent visits</li></ol>

<h2>Use Cases</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Client proposals:</strong> Share private documents with a password</li><li><strong>Early access:</strong> Gate beta product pages</li><li><strong>Internal resources:</strong> Share company links with simple auth</li><li><strong>Exclusive content:</strong> Paid content behind a password wall</li></ul>

<h2>Requirements</h2>
<p>Password protection requires the <strong>Pro plan</strong> or higher.</p>
